    description: "Handles FlexLM errors, license server connectivity issues, seat count questions, and license expiry for all DISW products."
    reasoning:
        instructions: |
            The customer has a license issue. Use the {!@actions.search_knowledge} action to search Salesforce Knowledge for a relevant license troubleshooting article.
